Z||000006||Monkeyman||06-03-2001||10:34 PM||||Speaking of MSCONFIG...How can I tell what some of the programs do?  There are a ton of things checked that I'm sure I could safely uncheck, but I don't want to uncheck anything important.  How about I submit a list of the things that are checked and you computer gurus tell me what they are?  Anyone interested?  Might be easier if I email someone.<P>MM||||reg||1
