Z||000008||p4n1c||06-04-2001||10:40 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Songman:<BR><B>Good thing you guys are running Windows 2000! There is no longer an msconfig command! I have no idea how to cut things off! But as fast and efficient as this operating system I haven't had to worry about anything like that anyway...<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>There shouldn't be stuff for 2k like there is for DOS based Windows versions.  It's mostly all dependant on the services or whatever the user throws in the startup folder.||||reg||1
